@startuml Login Admin
!theme plain

title Login Admin

actor Admin
participant Sistem
database Database

Admin -> Sistem: Buka halaman login
Sistem --> Admin: Tampilkan form login

Admin -> Sistem: Input email & password
Sistem -> Database: Validasi kredensial

alt Login Berhasil
    Database --> Sistem: Data user valid (Role: Admin)
    Sistem --> Admin: Redirect ke Dashboard Admin
else Login Gagal
    Database --> Sistem: Kredensial salah
    Sistem --> Admin: Tampilkan pesan error
end

@enduml
